    "detailed_description": "Sapiens is a crafting based management/idle colony simulator. You to start from small stone age band and grow through all of history. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou'll craft, research and manage your way through 8 ages: Stone, Bronze, Iron, Medieval, Exploration, Industrial, Modern and Future. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nExplore over 300 unique crafts as you grow and advance.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCan you lead your workers to glory? Will you be a peaceful society or ruthless and pragmatic?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf you mange to survive and outpace your competition, you'll face a final challenge as a global government running a futuristic planet that is on the brink of extinction.",
